(Tables 3 and 4 tie it to the mating part), so the tests only bound the guard with it: the
tabulated pin touches well inside the window. A change of the last printed digit
therefore leaves the run green (21 passed) and only a change that crosses the pin's contact
fails. The cells are held to the exact printed digits by 34-16's check of the real table
file against these constants, not by this file.
